{
  "name": "W5 \u00b7 Completion to cash \u2014 Tax & Treuhand Advisory",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W5 \u2014 Completion to cash \u00b7 Tax & Treuhand Advisory\n\n**Boundary: automatic issue only when the invoice matches the approved quote exactly. Any variation goes to a human.**\nThe test is not size, it is whether the amount differs from what was agreed. Scored 3/4/4.\n\n### Two lags, both worth measuring\n`completion \u2192 invoice` is the one automation moves, often dramatically \u2014 the person who finishes the job is not the person who invoices, and that handover is where days disappear.\n\n`invoice \u2192 paid` mostly is not yours to move. Report both and be honest about which one you affected.\n\nIf roughly a quarter of your work carries a variation, the gate fires on one in four \u2014 and that rate is the number that tells you whether this workflow is worth its complexity.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "fd0712fa-8869-41e1-847e-8963dbefdc46",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -860,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "path": "job-complete",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "77dc5ff2-0d3e-4769-92dd-7f7e4ff4113a",
      "name": "Mandate marked complete",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -320,
        -100
      ],
      "webhookId": "75de7c76-a8d6-4bf1-ba6e-fed6b8c380c0"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
